  "body": "<h1><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Lecture Notes</strong></span></h1>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9999%; height: 87px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%; background-color: #ccccff; height: 28px;\">No.</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%; background-color: #ccccff; height: 28px;\">Topic</td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%; background-color: #ccccff; height: 28px;\">References</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 184px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%; height: 49px;\" width=\"5%\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%; height: 49px;\" width=\"39%\">Overview (<a class=\"instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file\" title=\"overview.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12596674/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12596674\" data-api-returntype=\"File\">ppt</a>)&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%; height: 49px;\" width=\"246%\">\n<p>Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques. Jiawei Han, Jian Pei and Hanghang Tong. Morgan Kaufmann Publishers (4th edition)</p>\n<p>Introduction to Data Mining. Pang-Ning Tan, Michael Steinbach, Vipin Kumar. Pearson (2nd edition)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Association (<a class=\"instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file inline_disabled\" title=\"rule.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440370?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440370\" data-api-returntype=\"File\">ppt</a>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\" width=\"246%\">R. Agrawal, R. Srikant, \"Fast Algorithms for Mining Association Rules\", VLDB 1994 (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"FastAlgorithmsForMiningAssociationRules.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440325/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440325\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"7941081\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_2\">pdf</a></span></span>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">3</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>FP-Tree (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled preview_in_overlay\" title=\"fp-tree.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440331?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440331\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"9222781\">ppt</a></span></span>)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">J. Han, J. Pei, Y. Yin, \"Mining Frequent Patterns without Candidate Generation\", SIGMOD 2000 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"MiningFrequentPatternsWithoutCandidateGeneration.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440414/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440414\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_3\" data-id=\"4974349\">pdf</a></span>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Clustering (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled preview_in_overlay\" title=\"dendrogram.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440300?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440300\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"9222936\">ppt</a></span></span>)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques. Jiawei Han, Jian Pei and Hanghang Tong. Morgan Kaufmann Publishers (4th edition)</p>\n<p>Introduction to Data Mining. Pang-Ning Tan, Michael Steinbach, Vipin Kumar. Pearson (2nd edition)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">5</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Other Clustering Techniques (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled preview_in_overlay\" title=\"otherClustering.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440401?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440401\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"9222950\">ppt</a></span></span>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>A. P. Demster, N. M. Laird, D. B. Rubin, \"Maximum Likelihood from Incomplete Data via the EM Algorithm\", Journal of the Royal Statistical Society, Series B, Vol. 39, No. 1, 1977 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"MaximumLikelihoodFromIncompleteDataViaTheEMAlgorithm.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440322/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440322\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_8\" data-id=\"4974348\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span></p>\n<p>M. Ester, H.-P. Kriegel, J. Sander, X. Xu, \"A Density-based Algorithm for Discovering Clusters in Large Spatial Databases with Noise\", SIGKDD 1996 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"ADensityBasedAlgorithmForDiscoveringClusters in Large Spatial DatabasesWithNoise.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440327/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440327\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_4\" data-id=\"4974344\">pdf</a>)</span></p>\n<p>T. Zhang, R. Ramakrishnan, M. Livny, \"BIRCH: An efficient data clustering method for very large databases\", SIGMOD 1996 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"BIRCHAnEfficientDataClusteringMethodForVeryLargeDatabases.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440326/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440326\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_10\" data-id=\"4974334\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">6</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Outlier (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled preview_in_overlay\" title=\"outlier.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440402?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440402\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"9222837\">ppt</a></span></span>)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques. Jiawei Han, Jian Pei and Hanghang Tong. Morgan Kaufmann Publishers (4th edition)</p>\n<p>M. M. Breunig, H.-P. Kriegel, R. T. Ng, J. Sander, \"LOF: Identifying Density-Based Local Outliers\", SIGMOD 2000 (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"LOFIdentifyingDensityBasedLocalOutliers.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440332/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440332\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"4974347\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_5\">pdf</a></span></span><span>)</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">7</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Subspace Clustering (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled preview_in_overlay\" title=\"subspace.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440335?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440335\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"9222951\">ppt</a></span></span>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>K. Beyer, J. Goldstein, R. Ramakrishnan, U. Shaft, \"When is Nearest Neighbor Meaningful?\", ICDT 1999 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"WhenIsNearestNeighborMeaningful.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440358/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440358\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_6\" data-id=\"4974506\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>R. Agrawal, J. Gehrke, D. Gunopulos, P Raghavan, \"Automatic Subspace Clustering of High Dimensional Data for Data Mining Applications\", SIGMOD 1998 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"AutomaticSubspaceClusteringOfHighDimensionalDataForDataMiningApplications.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440324/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440324\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_7\" data-id=\"4974505\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>C.-H. Cheng, A. W.-C. Fu and Y. Zhang, \"Entropy-based Subspace Clustering for Mining Numerical Data\", SIGKDD 1999 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"EntropyBasedSubspaceClusteringForMiningNumericalData.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440346/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440346\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_8\" data-id=\"4974346\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Classification (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled preview_in_overlay\" title=\"classification.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440415?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440415\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"9222938\">ppt</a></span></span>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques. Jiawei Han, Jian Pei and Hanghang Tong. Morgan Kaufmann Publishers (4th edition)</p>\n<p>Introduction to Data Mining. Pang-Ning Tan, Michael Steinbach, Vipin Kumar. Pearson (2nd edition)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">9</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Other Classification Model 1:<br>Support Vector Machine (<span class=\"ally-file-link-holder link_holder\"><span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled preview_in_overlay\" title=\"SVM.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440315?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440315\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" data-id=\"9222762\">ppt</a></span></span>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques. Jiawei Han, Jian Pei and Hanghang Tong. Morgan Kaufmann Publishers (4th edition)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">10</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Other Classification Model 2:<br>Neural Network (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"neuralNetwork.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440319/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440319\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_19\" data-id=\"4974492\">ppt</a></span>)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques. Jiawei Han, Jian Pei and Hanghang Tong. Morgan Kaufmann Publishers (4th edition)</p>\n<p>Introduction to Data Mining. Pang-Ning Tan, Michael Steinbach, Vipin Kumar. Pearson (2nd edition)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">11</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Other Classification Model 3:<br>Recurrent Neural Network (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"recurrentNeuralNetwork.pptx\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440362/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440362\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_20\" data-id=\"4974536\">pptx</a></span>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>S. Hochreiter, J. Schmidhuber. \"Long Short-Term Memory\", Neural Computation. 9 (8): 1735–1780 (1997) (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"LongShortTermMemory.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440351/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440351\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_9\" data-id=\"4974544\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;K. Cho, B. Merrienboer, C. Gulcehre, D. Bahdanau, F. Bougares, H. Schwenk, Y. Bengio. \"Learning Phrase Representations</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">12</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Data Warehouse (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"datawarehouse.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440369/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440369\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_23\" data-id=\"4974341\">ppt</a></span>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>V. Harinarayan, A. Rajaraman, J. Ullman, \"Implementing Data Cubes Efficiently\", SIGMOD 1996 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"ImplementingDataCubesEfficiently.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440323/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440323\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_11\" data-id=\"4974495\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">13</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Data Mining over Data Streams (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"dataStream.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440328/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440328\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_25\" data-id=\"4974509\">ppt</a></span>)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p>G. S. Manku, R. Motwani, \"Approximate Frequency Counts over Data Streams\", VLDB 2002 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"ApproximateFrequencyCountsOverDataStreams.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440367/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440367\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_12\" data-id=\"4974504\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;A. Metwally, D. Agrawal, A. El Abbadi, \"Efficient Computation of Frequent and Top-k Elements in Data Streams\", ICDT 2005 (<span class=\"instructure_file_holder link_holder instructure_file_link_holder ally-file-link-holder\"><a class=\"file_preview_link previewable\" title=\"EfficientComputationOfFrequentAndTop-kElementsInDataStreams.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440364/download?wrap=1\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440364\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"preview_13\" data-id=\"4974343\">pdf</a></span><span>)</span>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 3.79493%;\">14</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.5485%;\"><span>Other Data Stream Models (<a class=\"instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file inline_disabled\" title=\"otherDataStream.ppt\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440318?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440318\" data-api-returntype=\"File\">ppt</a>)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.623%;\">\n<p><span>P. Domingos and G. Hulten, \"Mining High-Speed Data Streams\", SIGKDD 2000 (<a class=\"instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file inline_disabled\" title=\"MiningHighSpeedDataStreams.pdf\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/files/12440356?wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/files/12440356\" data-api-returntype=\"File\">pdf</a>)</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
